HOW IT WORKS
Getting TryHackMe SEC0 certified
Step 1
Complete the learning

Complete the Pre Security learning pathway to develop core technical understanding of how computers, operating systems, networks, and the internet function — the foundations required before diving into cyber security.
Step 2
Start the exam

Apply your foundational skills in a theoritical and practical exam that tests real understanding, not memorisation. The exam assesses your ability to think technically and solve problems with systems, networks, and web technologies.
Step 3
Get certified and progress with confidence

After you pass, you'll receive your SEC0 certificate and digital badge that you can share with employers or on LinkedIn. Use your SEC0 certification as verified proof that you've built the right foundations and are ready to continue your cyber security journey with SEC1 and beyond.
